   ("GET /pay/quote?usd=0.5" "200 — 旧虚偽値のまま: chain=ethereum / custody=safe-multisig / usdc-contract=Eth mainnet 0xA0b8…6eB48 (Base 修正未反映)")
   ("GET /.well-known/x402" "200 — network=base, payTo=0xf15928…67Ac, $0.50, facilitator=x402.nexus 正常")
